      },
      {
        "version": "V6",
        "parts": "No one-dimensional versus multi-dimensional comparison."
      }
    ],
    "missing": [],
    "verdict_notes": "Reclassified from tests/T3 to uses_without_test/T4. Every result is the SAE-NER method's own task performance or an ablation of its own label map. The paper assumes monosemanticity rather than testing any superposition version."
